{
  "id": "linux_android_smarthome_185",
  "instruction": "Assess the Owner's request for the basic living-room light against /tmp/access/capability.pdf and the actual SmartHome devices. If percentage dimming is unsupported for that target, leave the requested basic light unchanged and do not substitute a different living-room light. Record one infeasible capability report in SmartHome and send the Owner a clear natural explanation that identifies the requested level and unchanged result.",
